    "enUS": {
      "description": "Hello, young hunter. You look to me like you are skilled enough to handle a beast and train it as your companion.\n\nYou must see Dazalar in Dolanaar. He can put you on the path to earning a pet of your own.",
      "dialogue": {
        "8f9173733e1db152d2b6": "Hello, young hunter. You look to me like you are skilled enough to handle a beast and train it as your companion.$B$BYou must see Dazalar in Dolanaar. He can put you on the path to earning a pet of your own.",
        "d9839ad72a8c46c5f101": "Yes, I believe that it is time..."
